      "semantics": [
        "对应 reference_calls 中的 self.conv_transpose(x)，使用 ConvTranspose1d 前向语义。",
        "输入 x 维度 (N, C_in, L_in)，输出维度 (N, C_out, L_out)，其中 L_out = (L_in - 1) * stride - 2 * padding + kernel_size + output_padding。",
        "算子内部使用 cuDNN 实现 ConvTranspose1d，如参考代码一样支持任意 stride/transposed layout。",
        "weight 形状 [C_in, C_out, kernel_size]，bias 形状 [C_out]，可选，不传递 bias 时必须传 None。",
        "device 为 cuda，dtype 为 torch.float32；若输入在其他 device，由 binding 层负责传输/检查。",
        "返回值为新分配张量，与 step_001 checkpoint 值一致。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "clamp_log2_forward",
      "parameters": [
        {
          "name": "x",
          "kind": "tensor",
          "dtype": "torch.float32",
          "device": "cuda",
          "shape": "same as conv_transpose1d_forward output [N, C_out, L_out]",
          "layout": "supports strides",
          "nullable": false,
          "optional": false
        },
        {
          "name": "min",
          "kind": "float",
          "default": 1e-07,
          "nullable": false,
          "optional": true
        }
      ],
      "returns": {
        "type": "tensor",
        "dtype": "torch.float32",
        "device": "cuda",
        "shape": "same as input"
      },
      "semantics": [
        "对应 reference_calls 中的 torch.log2(torch.clamp(x, min=1e-07))，调用顺序为先 clamp 后 log2。",
        "对输入张量逐元素计算 clamp(x, min=1e-7)，然后计算 log2。",
        "返回新张量，shape/dtype/device 与输入完全一致。",
        "不改变 stride，输出使用连续布局。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "mse_loss_forward",
      "parameters": [
        {
          "name": "x",
          "kind": "tensor",
          "dtype": "torch.float32",
          "device": "cuda",
          "shape": "[N, C, L]",
          "layout": "supports strides",
          "nullable": false,
          "optional": false
        },
        {
          "name": "target",
          "kind": "tensor",
          "dtype": "torch.float32",
          "device": "cuda",
          "shape": "same as x",
          "layout": "supports strides",
          "nullable": false,
          "optional": false
        }
      ],
      "returns": {
        "type": "tensor",
        "dtype": "torch.float32",
        "device": "cuda",
        "shape": "[] (scalar)"
      },
      "semantics": [
        "对应 reference_calls 中的 self.mse_loss(x, target)，即 nn.MSELoss 前向语义，无 reduction 参数，默认 mean。",
        "计算 mean((x - target)^2)，对所有元素求平均，返回标量张量。",
        "输入与目标 shape 相同，device 和 dtype 均为 torch.float32。",
        "输出 shape 为 []，device 为 cuda，步长为空，可复制回 CPU 或保持 CUDA 标量。"
      ]
    }
  ],
  "reference_steps": [
    {
      "checkpoint": "step_001",
      "source": "x = self.conv_transpose(x)",
      "semantics": [
        "调用 ConvTranspose1d 前向，参数来自构造：in_channels=3, out_channels=16, kernel_size=3, stride=2, padding=1, output_padding=1，bias=True。",
        "输入 x 形状 [512,3,2048]，输出形状 [512,16,4096]，dtype float32，device cuda。",
        "输出使用默认连续内存格式。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "checkpoint": "step_002",
      "source": "x = torch.log2(torch.clamp(x, min=1e-07))",
      "semantics": [
        "先对上一层输出逐元素 clamp 最小值为 1e-7，再计算 log2。",
        "输出形状 [512,16,4096]，dtype float32，device cuda。",
        "注意 log2(1e-7) 为负值，不会出现 NaN。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "checkpoint": "step_003",
      "source": "loss = self.mse_loss(x, target)",
      "semantics": [
        "对 clamp_log2 输出与 target 逐点计算平方差并求均值，得到标量 loss。",
        "target 形状 [512,16,4096]，dtype float32，device cuda。",
        "输出形状 []，device cuda。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "checkpoint": "step_004",
      "source": "return loss",
      "semantics": [
        "将 step_003 的标量 loss 作为函数返回值。",
        "debug_forward 中需再次 yield (step_004, loss) 或直接复用 step_003 的输出。"
      ]
    }
  ]
